==========

A Vertex AI Pipeline is a workflow that connects multiple machine learning steps—such as data preparation, training, evaluation, 
and deployment—so they can be executed in an organized, repeatable, and potentially automated process.

==========

emember this:
🧩 Component
= One individual task

🔗 Pipeline
= Multiple connected components/tasks

🤖 Automation
= Pipeline executes the workflow

So, in simple words:

Pipeline is like a factory assembly line for your AI/ML project. Each step does its job, passes the result to the next step, and finally produces a trained and usable model.


